    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Project Thinking & Scope Support Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this chat to think through your project’s idea, audience, scope, and potential impact. It can help you clarify what problem your app is trying to solve, who it’s for, and what this first version should include or leave out.\r\n\r\nThis chat supports **thinking and decision-making**, not planning tasks or building features.\r\n\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Need a starting prompt?**]\r\n> I have a few ideas for my capstone project, but I’m not sure which one feels most meaningful. Can you help me think it through?\r\n\r\n> I know who my app might be for, but I’m struggling to clearly define the problem it should address. Can you help me refine that?\r\n\r\n> I’m not sure what my first version should include versus what can wait. Can you help me think about scope and tradeoffs?\r\n\r\n> I want to think about who this project helps and who it might unintentionally exclude. Can you help me reflect on that?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
